## ConnectionSelector.razor

**Namespace**: `Cyrena.Components.Shared`
**Assembly**: `Cyrena.Components.Core`
**Location**: `Components/Shared/ConnectionSelector.razor` + `ConnectionSelector.razor.cs`

### Purpose
Blazor shared component that displays a dropdown of available AI connections from all registered `IConnectionProvider` services. Supports two-way value binding for selecting a connection ID.

### Component Markup
```razor
<MudSelect T="string" Value="Value" ValueChanged="ValueChanged"
           Label="@Label"
           Variant="Variant.Outlined" Dense="true"
           AdornmentIcon="@Icons.Material.Filled.Cable"
           Required="Required"
           Immediate
           Adornment="Adornment.Start">
    <MudSelectItem Value="@((string?)null)">-- Select --</MudSelectItem>
    @foreach (var item in _models)
    {
        <MudSelectItem Value="@item.Id">@item.Name (@item.Source)</MudSelectItem>
    }
</MudSelect>
```

### Parameters

| Parameter | Type | Default | Description |
|-----------|------|---------|-------------|
| `Value` | `string?` | `null` | Selected connection ID (two-way bindable) |
| `ValueChanged` | `EventCallback<string?>` | — | Fires when selection changes |
| `Label` | `string?` | `"AI Connection"` | Label text for the dropdown |
| `Required` | `bool` | `true` | Whether selection is required |

### Code-Behind

```csharp
public partial class ConnectionSelector
{
    [Inject] private IServiceProvider _services { get; set; } = default!;
    [Parameter] public string? Value { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public EventCallback<string?> ValueChanged { get; set; }
    [Parameter] public string? Label { get; set; } = "AI Connection";
    [Parameter] public bool Required { get; set; } = true;

    private IEnumerable<IConnectionProvider> _providers = default!;
    private List<ConnectionInfo> _models { get; set; } = new();

    protected override void OnInitialized()
    {
        _providers = _services.GetServices<IConnectionProvider>();
    }

    protected override async Task OnAfterRenderAsync(bool firstRender)
    {
        if (!firstRender) return;
        await Populate();
        this.StateHasChanged();
    }

    private async Task Populate()
    {
        _models.Clear();
        foreach (var item in _providers)
        {
            var infos = await item.ListConnectionsAsync();
            _models.AddRange(infos);
        }
    }
}
```

### Behavior

1. **Initialization** (`OnInitialized`): Resolves all `IConnectionProvider` services from DI.
2. **First Render** (`OnAfterRenderAsync`): Calls `Populate()` to load connections, then triggers re-render.
3. **Selection Change** (`ValueChanged`): Fires `ValueChanged` event with the selected connection ID.

### Display Format
Each option shows: `Name (Source)` where:
- `Name` = `ConnectionInfo.Name`
- `Source` = `ConnectionInfo.Source` (provider identifier)

### Dependencies
- `IConnectionProvider` - Contract for connection providers
- `ConnectionInfo` - Model for connection metadata

### Related
- `IConnectionProvider` - Connection provider contract
- `ConnectionInfo` - Connection metadata model
